      <p><a href="https://www.medicare.gov/publications/12211-whats-the-medicare-prescription-payment-plan.pdf" title="What is Medicare Prescription Payment Plan" target="_blank" class="aProductMsg" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="pdf-alert">English</a> | <a href="${aepYearDocumentHref('89790814')}" title="What is Medicare Prescription Payment Plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="pdf-alert">Spanish</a> | <a href="https://www.medicare.gov/publications/12211-c-whats-the-medicare-prescription-payment-plan.pdf" title="What is Medicare Prescription Payment Plan" target="_blank" class="aProductMsg" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="pdf-alert">Chinese</a> | <a href="https://www.medicare.gov/publications/12211-k-whats-the-medicare-prescription-payment-plan.pdf" title="What is Medicare Prescription Payment Plan" target="_blank" class="aProductMsg" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="pdf-alert">Korean</a> | <a href="https://www.medicare.gov/publications/12211-v-whats-the-medicare-prescription-payment-plan.pdf" title="What is Medicare Prescription Payment Plan" target="_blank" class="aProductMsg" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="pdf-alert">Vietnamese </a></p>
      <p><strong>There's no cost to participate in the Medicare Prescription Payment Plan. Participation is voluntary.</strong></p>
      <h3>How do I Opt-in?</h3>
      <p>SimplicityRx is managing the Medicare Prescription Payment plan on behalf of your Optimum HealthCare Plan.</p>
      <p>If you have already registered with SimplicityRx, please go to the <a href="https://member.rxpayments.com/" title="SimplicityRx Member Portal" target="_blank" class="aProductMsg" rel="noopener">SimplicityRx Member Portal</a> and login using your registered username and password.</p>
      <p>If you are interested in participating in this payment plan, please follow one of the options below.</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Complete the SimplicityRx Participation Request form online at <a href="https://activate.rxpayments.com/" title="SimplicityRx Participation Portal" target="_blank" class="aProductMsg" rel="noopener">SimplicityRx Participation Portal</a>.</li>
        <li>Call SimplicityRx at 1-833-246-7709 (TTY: 711) to submit your Participation Request via telephone.</li>
        <li>Download the SimplicityRx Participation Request form below, fill out and mail back as per the instructions in the form. Newly enrolled members will also receive a copy of this form in their new member packet.<br><a href="${aepYearDocumentHref('17208880')}" title="SimplicityRx Participation Request form" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="pdf-alert">English</a> | <a href="${aepYearDocumentHref('90226183')}" title="SimplicityRx Participation Request form" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="pdf-alert">Spanish</a></li>
      </ol>
      <p>If you need more information regarding the Medicare Prescription Payment Plan or need help completing the Participation Request form, please contact SimplicityRx at 1-833-246-7709 (TTY: 711) Monday through Friday 8am to 8pm EST.</p>
      <p>Please visit <a href="https://www.medicare.gov/prescription-payment-plan" title="Medicare.gov" target="_blank" class="aProductMsg" rel="noopener">Medicare.gov</a> for interactive educational materials, tools and examples related to the Medicare Prescription Payment Plan.</p>
      <p>We appreciate you trusting us as your health partner.</p>
    `;
